# Razor Emilie Fischl Bennett. ~20s Rotation with 2E Sapwood Bennett. Razor Quickload w/ ~70% Quicken Uptime. Razor maintains burning with Bennett C6 infusion. SS may be inconsistent, but exceed TS without refines. Emilie Q every other rot after the first. Deepwood and & NO Bennett are similar. Self-Overloads not implemented; Real gameplay may prefer more EM to Razor/Bennett.

